WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.432 --> 00:00:01.528
- Good morning Believe Nation,

00:00:01.528 --> 00:00:05.360
today's message is rediscover yourself.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.173
Over to you A.R. Rahman.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.413
(rooster calling)

00:00:09.413 --> 00:00:11.831
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:11.831 --> 00:00:14.512
♫ Espresso keep me goin'

00:00:14.512 --> 00:00:18.012
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:18.947 --> 00:00:20.864
- What is modern is ...

00:00:23.113 --> 00:00:24.585
Rediscovering yourself,

00:00:24.585 --> 00:00:27.565
rediscovering the way
music is done is modern.

00:00:27.565 --> 00:00:31.148
I do love to embrace
new technology and ...

00:00:32.703 --> 00:00:34.259
new ideas.

00:00:34.259 --> 00:00:37.390
Especially like in the film like "Slumdog"

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:41.757
where Danny I said just "Am
I a someone?", you know,

00:00:41.757 --> 00:00:44.189
in the tradition of music and everything.

00:00:44.189 --> 00:00:46.710
So it was like two
cultures meeting in way.

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:48.368
Like some of the people
who are very close-minded.

00:00:48.368 --> 00:00:50.195
They say "Oh what are they doing?

00:00:50.195 --> 00:00:51.653
"It's just noise.

00:00:51.653 --> 00:00:54.832
"Rap is noise and heavy metal is noise".

00:00:54.832 --> 00:00:57.104
So when you go into that frame of just

00:00:57.104 --> 00:01:00.535
try to like something for what it is

00:01:00.535 --> 00:01:03.785
You know, go take a lens and disrupt it

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:06.758
and try and analyze it.

00:01:06.758 --> 00:01:08.876
So with this philosophy, I think.

00:01:08.876 --> 00:01:10.995
I kept moving on for like eight years,

00:01:10.995 --> 00:01:12.387
rediscovering myself.

00:01:12.387 --> 00:01:14.244
- So rediscovered myself every day.

00:01:14.244 --> 00:01:15.077
Every single day,

00:01:15.077 --> 00:01:17.165
even just through this YouTube channel,

00:01:17.165 --> 00:01:18.338
I rediscover myself.

00:01:18.338 --> 00:01:19.893
I started this channel.

00:01:19.893 --> 00:01:21.446
One of the main reasons was

00:01:21.446 --> 00:01:23.648
I wanted to learn myself.

00:01:23.648 --> 00:01:25.806
I wanted a better environment for myself.

00:01:25.806 --> 00:01:27.264
I wanted to surround myself with people

00:01:27.264 --> 00:01:29.177
who've done more than I've done

00:01:29.177 --> 00:01:30.530
and learn from them.

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:32.301
And every time I make a top ten video

00:01:32.301 --> 00:01:33.383
an "Entspresso" video,

00:01:33.383 --> 00:01:34.318
"BelieveLife" video,

00:01:34.318 --> 00:01:35.626
any of the videos that I put out

00:01:35.626 --> 00:01:36.707
three times a day.

00:01:36.707 --> 00:01:39.811
I put them up because I've
learned something from them.

00:01:39.811 --> 00:01:41.530
When somebody says a message

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:43.241
I take it and I try,

00:01:43.241 --> 00:01:44.223
not to be like them.

00:01:44.223 --> 00:01:45.761
The goal isn't to be like that person.

00:01:45.761 --> 00:01:47.806
It's to be a better version of ourselves.

00:01:47.806 --> 00:01:49.162
And when they give you that message,

00:01:49.162 --> 00:01:51.013
think about how it's
going to impact your life,

00:01:51.013 --> 00:01:52.380
how it's going to impact your business.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:53.822
How can you apply it some way.

00:01:53.822 --> 00:01:55.548
If you're just consuming content

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:56.887
and you don't apply it anywhere,

00:01:56.887 --> 00:01:58.590
it's not a good use of time.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:01:59.855
It's a great mental exercise I guess

00:01:59.855 --> 00:02:01.985
but nothing else is going
to change in your life

00:02:01.985 --> 00:02:03.350
until you take action.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:04.201
What's really interesting is

00:02:04.201 --> 00:02:05.885
a lot of the lessons are the same.

00:02:05.885 --> 00:02:07.440
From the musicians we've covered

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:08.909
and athletes and entrepreneurs

00:02:08.909 --> 00:02:10.350
and inventors and politicians.

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:11.917
A lot of the messages are the same.

00:02:11.917 --> 00:02:14.973
A lot of the messages
for success are the same.

00:02:14.973 --> 00:02:17.276
But hearing it consistently,

00:02:17.276 --> 00:02:18.359
I find helps.

00:02:19.232 --> 00:02:21.592
If you are not getting
the results that you want,

00:02:21.592 --> 00:02:23.942
if you have these big goals and
you're nowhere close to them

00:02:23.942 --> 00:02:25.567
and you don't see that
happening in the next,

00:02:25.567 --> 00:02:27.827
you know few weeks, months, years.

00:02:27.827 --> 00:02:30.220
If you're not making
the progress towards it.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:31.854
If you feel you have
the untapped potential

00:02:31.854 --> 00:02:33.223
and you don't know how to
go out and accomplish it,

00:02:33.223 --> 00:02:35.634
it's likely 'cause you
have a poor mindset.

00:02:35.634 --> 00:02:37.416
From your parents and
the people around you.

00:02:37.416 --> 00:02:38.249
From your neighborhood,

00:02:38.249 --> 00:02:39.112
from your environment.

00:02:39.112 --> 00:02:41.106
You have a poor mindset that
holds you where you are.

00:02:41.106 --> 00:02:42.252
And the way to break free of it

00:02:42.252 --> 00:02:43.809
is to surround yourself with people

00:02:43.809 --> 00:02:45.117
who have a better mindset,

00:02:45.117 --> 00:02:46.299
a more empowering mindset,

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:48.743
a more impactful mindset.

00:02:48.743 --> 00:02:51.368
And so I do it by hanging around these

00:02:51.368 --> 00:02:54.378
successful entrepreneurs every single day.

00:02:54.378 --> 00:02:55.977
I don't have the people,

00:02:55.977 --> 00:02:58.278
physical people that I can go and talk to

00:02:58.278 --> 00:02:59.415
who push me to be better.

00:02:59.415 --> 00:03:02.054
I get it by watching these videos.

00:03:02.054 --> 00:03:02.987
And so I challenge you to think.

00:03:02.987 --> 00:03:04.873
If you're not getting your goals,

00:03:04.873 --> 00:03:06.388
look at your environment

00:03:06.388 --> 00:03:07.638
and see if you're doing the right things.

00:03:07.638 --> 00:03:09.888
And yes a lot of these
messages will be the same,

00:03:09.888 --> 00:03:12.158
consistently over and over again.

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:13.858
But hearing it from somebody else

00:03:13.858 --> 00:03:17.762
in the words that they use, sometimes,

00:03:17.762 --> 00:03:19.255
that's the trigger.

00:03:19.255 --> 00:03:21.173
And hearing it consistently
helps break free

00:03:21.173 --> 00:03:24.108
of the poor mindset to go off
and accomplish bigger things.

00:03:24.108 --> 00:03:26.281
And sometimes it's just
an issue of timing.

00:03:26.281 --> 00:03:27.509
You may have heard the message before

00:03:27.509 --> 00:03:30.219
but for some reason today
you're ready to hear it

00:03:30.219 --> 00:03:32.100
and to actually take some action on it.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.611
If you want to do big things,

00:03:33.611 --> 00:03:34.878
if you want to accomplish a big goal

00:03:34.878 --> 00:03:39.325
then you have to be continually
rediscovering yourself.

00:03:39.325 --> 00:03:40.649
And if you're not doing it

00:03:40.649 --> 00:03:42.119
then you're going to stay where you are.

00:03:42.119 --> 00:03:44.175
So I encourage you to pick up the mantle

00:03:44.175 --> 00:03:45.572
and take some action.

00:03:45.572 --> 00:03:46.854
So the question of the day today is,

00:03:46.854 --> 00:03:49.476
"I'm curious, what do you
do on a consistent basis

00:03:49.476 --> 00:03:50.984
"to rediscover yourself."

00:03:50.984 --> 00:03:52.483
Leave it down in the comments below.

00:03:52.483 --> 00:03:54.165
Super curious to find out.

00:03:54.165 --> 00:03:55.997
I also want to give a quick
shout-out to Andre Martin.

00:03:55.997 --> 00:03:58.227
Andre, thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:03:58.227 --> 00:03:59.436
"Your One Word".

00:03:59.436 --> 00:04:01.206
It really really really
means a lot to me man

00:04:01.206 --> 00:04:02.632
and I hope you're enjoying the reading.

00:04:02.632 --> 00:04:03.968
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:04:03.968 --> 00:04:05.236
I believe in you.

00:04:05.236 --> 00:04:07.068
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:04:07.068 --> 00:04:08.851
and whatever your one word is,

00:04:08.851 --> 00:04:11.584
much love and I'll see
you again tomorrow morning

00:04:11.584 --> 00:04:14.324
for another shot of "Entspresso".

00:04:14.324 --> 00:04:16.873
♫ I wake up every morning.

00:04:16.873 --> 00:04:20.925
♫ Espresso keep me goin'

00:04:20.925 --> 00:04:22.774
(tapping)

00:04:22.774 --> 00:04:27.067
- Sure we all have to all
set goals for ourselves.

00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:28.601
I mean our planned destination

00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:29.601
is to be ...

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.584
busy ...

00:04:32.584 --> 00:04:36.751
and to you know adjust to
whatever you're introduced to.

00:04:38.645 --> 00:04:40.072
And what I mean by that is

00:04:40.072 --> 00:04:43.957
okay as an entertainer I
started off as a singer.

00:04:43.957 --> 00:04:46.449
You know I grew to be a
dancer and a performer.

00:04:46.449 --> 00:04:48.655
After becoming a performer
then I became an actor.

00:04:48.655 --> 00:04:50.910
After becoming an actor
I became an entrepreneur.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:53.789
After becoming an entrepreneur
I became an entertainer

00:04:53.789 --> 00:04:55.908
on a different level of
introducing other artists.

00:04:55.908 --> 00:04:59.753
Then, you know after
that I became a mentor.

00:04:59.753 --> 00:05:01.969
- Right.
- You know, so I think just

00:05:01.969 --> 00:05:03.940
- to continue to evolve

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.796
in a way that is beneficial

00:05:05.796 --> 00:05:08.463
for growth of myself and others.

00:05:10.231 --> 00:05:13.266
My likeness to continue to be
remembered throughout history

00:05:13.266 --> 00:05:16.622
and associated with something great.

00:05:16.622 --> 00:05:17.455
- Wow.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.910
For me you know,

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:22.993
there's a mantra that ...

00:05:24.188 --> 00:05:25.807
I've lived by.

00:05:25.807 --> 00:05:27.974
And it is that the journey

00:05:30.325 --> 00:05:34.472
of the destination is
really what it's all about.

00:05:34.472 --> 00:05:35.722
The pursuit ...

00:05:37.932 --> 00:05:41.849
