00:07:23.521 --> 00:07:24.555
for my whole life.

00:07:24.555 --> 00:07:26.329
I want to be able to change

00:07:26.329 --> 00:07:29.746
and you know I respect the people who ...

00:07:31.267 --> 00:07:33.632
loved you know, '07 Nicki and

00:07:33.632 --> 00:07:38.127
