some stuff on Pink Friday.

00:07:38.127 --> 00:07:40.156
Like I'm not forgetting anybody.

00:07:40.156 --> 00:07:42.835
But I just also have to be true to me.

00:07:42.835 --> 00:07:44.318
And the truth is,

00:07:44.318 --> 00:07:46.936
I started seeing different things.

00:07:46.936 --> 00:07:48.492
I started going different places.

00:07:48.492 --> 00:07:49.816
I started eating different things.

00:07:49.816 --> 00:07:51.241
I can't ...

00:07:51.241 --> 00:07:55.444
